      },
      "message": "test(pathkernel): the old-planner baseline of each phase-1 kind\n\nRecord the output of the old planners on side/path-kernel for the 15\nphase-1 kinds that had no baseline, in the #3750 form (CL text at 1 um,\none note line for each note; the app pin adds the verifier warnings).\n\n- Motion level: 15 pins in pass_start_levels/kernel_baseline/ (Face,\n  2D Contour, 2D Adaptive spiral and trochoidal, Engrave, V-Carve,\n  2D Chamfer, Circular, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Trace, Slot Undercut,\n  Thread, Bore, 3D Pocket), 90 goldens kernel_<kind>_<case>.cl.\n- App level: the 2D Pocket on fig8.step, 5 cases, heavy lane with a\n  light twin, goldens kernel_pocket2d_fig8_<case>.cl.\n\nNo planner code and no existing golden changes.\n\nRefs #4153\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
