      "message": "test(cl): round-trip the CL text of an annotated golden\n\nThe baseline goldens of #4153 end with `; note:` and `; warning:`\nlines. The round-trip test reads only the CL text before them. The\nhunk is byte-identical to the one of PR #4123 (#4055), so the two\nbranches merge cleanly in either order.\n\nRefs #4153\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
